+| `D`      | hex16   | Direct page.                                                |
+| `SH`     | hex8    | High byte of the 16-bit stack pointer: `S` is at `SH:S`.    |
+| `AH`/`XH`/`YH` | hex8 | High bytes of the 16-bit accumulator and index registers. |
+| `E`      | integer | Emulation flag: 1 in emulation mode, 0 in native mode.      |
